 <p>
 There are other activities that may be captured by an EHR that might not be of value to other providers (e.g. shaving, anesthesia, time admitted to recovery, etc.). The boundary between these classes may vary and is up to the judgment of the implementer. An option for capturing information of potential value that does not merit the name "procedure" is to use the note property.
 </p>
